{"record_id": "R13969", "asset_id": "R13969.main.32ca8cbb364b193d", "source_filename": "Pairin_tu_ch3_p.pdf", "source_sha256": "32ca8cbb364b193de87f882ae894fcbc5fef9f26ed5e6f97de81c52c3faf4e30", "canonical_source": "original_files/fulltext/R13969_Pairin_tu_ch3_p.pdf", "role": "main", "location": {"type": "pdf_block", "pdf_page": 2, "pdf_page_label": "", "block": 11, "bbox_points": [115.89994812011719, 499.4389953613281, 490.54876708984375, 606.04296875]}, "text": "• \nUpflow anaerobic sludge blanket reactors (UASB)\n• \nWet gas meter, Ritter, TG05/5\n• \nGas chromatograph(GC), AutoSystem, Perkin-Elmer\n• \nHigh-performance liquid chromatography(HPLC), RI detector,\nUFLC, Shimadzu\n", "text_method": "native", "chunk_id": "R13969.main.32ca8cbb364b193d:19"}
{"record_id": "R13969", "asset_id": "R13969.main.32ca8cbb364b193d", "source_filename": "Pairin_tu_ch3_p.pdf", "source_sha256": "32ca8cbb364b193de87f882ae894fcbc5fef9f26ed5e6f97de81c52c3faf4e30", "canonical_source": "original_files/fulltext/R13969_Pairin_tu_ch3_p.pdf", "role": "main", "location": {"type": "pdf_block", "pdf_page": 2, "pdf_page_label": "", "block": 12, "bbox_points": [158.64996337890625, 608.1390380859375, 388.22967529296875, 693.4429931640625]}, "text": "• \nCOD reactor, HACH DR3800\n• \nSpectrophotometer, HACH DRB200\n• \npH electrode ,Cole-palmer, KH-27012-27\n• \nPeristaltic pump\n", "text_method": "native", "chunk_id": "R13969.main.32ca8cbb364b193d:20"}
