{"record_id": "R13969", "asset_id": "R13969.main.32ca8cbb364b193d", "source_filename": "Pairin_tu_ch3_p.pdf", "source_sha256": "32ca8cbb364b193de87f882ae894fcbc5fef9f26ed5e6f97de81c52c3faf4e30", "canonical_source": "original_files/fulltext/R13969_Pairin_tu_ch3_p.pdf", "role": "main", "location": {"type": "pdf_block", "pdf_page": 5, "pdf_page_label": "", "block": 1, "bbox_points": [519.0, 37.73200225830078, 529.080078125, 56.32400131225586]}, "text": "31\n", "text_method": "native", "chunk_id": "R13969.main.32ca8cbb364b193d:33"}
{"record_id": "R13969", "asset_id": "R13969.main.32ca8cbb364b193d", "source_filename": "Pairin_tu_ch3_p.pdf", "source_sha256": "32ca8cbb364b193de87f882ae894fcbc5fef9f26ed5e6f97de81c52c3faf4e30", "canonical_source": "original_files/fulltext/R13969_Pairin_tu_ch3_p.pdf", "role": "main", "location": {"type": "pdf_block", "pdf_page": 5, "pdf_page_label": "", "block": 2, "bbox_points": [156.09991455078125, 116.20902252197266, 525.0448608398438, 200.0630645751953]}, "text": "24\n3.430\n2.320\n4\n6.860\n7.000\n36\n6.860\n1.160\n6\n13.720\n3.500\n48\n13.720\n0.580\n8\n27.440\n1.750\n60\n27.440\n0.290\n10\n54.880\n0.875\n", "text_method": "native", "chunk_id": "R13969.main.32ca8cbb364b193d:34"}
{"record_id": "R13969", "asset_id": "R13969.main.32ca8cbb364b193d", "source_filename": "Pairin_tu_ch3_p.pdf", "source_sha256": "32ca8cbb364b193de87f882ae894fcbc5fef9f26ed5e6f97de81c52c3faf4e30", "canonical_source": "original_files/fulltext/R13969_Pairin_tu_ch3_p.pdf", "role": "main", "location": {"type": "pdf_block", "pdf_page": 5, "pdf_page_label": "", "block": 3, "bbox_points": [118.89997863769531, 222.5590057373047, 532.946533203125, 326.06097412109375]}, "text": "In the second part, the optimum obtained in the first part were used to \noperate the two-stage UASB unit to investigate the effect of microaeration on \nmethane UASB volume by vary oxygen supply rate from 0.0 to 6.1 mLCVL\" \n^astewater-d'^or 5.04 to 7.55 mg02-g’1CODappliedd'1)shown in Table 3.3. to \ndetermine the optimum value for the anaerobic hydrolysis of the cellulosic fraction.\n", "text_method": "native", "chunk_id": "R13969.main.32ca8cbb364b193d:35"}
{"record_id": "R13969", "asset_id": "R13969.main.32ca8cbb364b193d", "source_filename": "Pairin_tu_ch3_p.pdf", "source_sha256": "32ca8cbb364b193de87f882ae894fcbc5fef9f26ed5e6f97de81c52c3faf4e30", "canonical_source": "original_files/fulltext/R13969_Pairin_tu_ch3_p.pdf", "role": "main", "location": {"type": "pdf_block", "pdf_page": 5, "pdf_page_label": "", "block": 4, "bbox_points": [118.69998168945312, 347.8089904785156, 532.9556884765625, 409.3609619140625]}, "text": "Table 3.3 Oxygen supply rate for determining the effect of oxygen added on \nmethane UASB volume without pH controlled under mesophilic temperature(COD = \n14 g-L-1)\n", "text_method": "native", "chunk_id": "R13969.main.32ca8cbb364b193d:36"}
{"record_id": "R13969", "asset_id": "R13969.main.32ca8cbb364b193d", "source_filename": "Pairin_tu_ch3_p.pdf", "source_sha256": "32ca8cbb364b193de87f882ae894fcbc5fef9f26ed5e6f97de81c52c3faf4e30", "canonical_source": "original_files/fulltext/R13969_Pairin_tu_ch3_p.pdf", "role": "main", "location": {"type": "pdf_block", "pdf_page": 5, "pdf_page_label": "", "block": 5, "bbox_points": [162.10098266601562, 432.3089904785156, 285.826904296875, 473.1629638671875]}, "text": "Oxygen supply rate \n(mL02'L'1wastewater-d'1)\n", "text_method": "native", "chunk_id": "R13969.main.32ca8cbb364b193d:37"}
